OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm spends #315k on village
OL,4,Anetwork upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water has said it is
OL,7,Finvesting #315,000 to upgrade the clean
OL,8,Fwater network in an East Yorkshire
OL,9,Fvillage.
OL,11,FThe six-week project, which includes
OL,12,Freplacing water mains and installing
OL,13,Fnew pipes, is due to start this week in
OL,14,FCherry Burton, near Beverley.
OL,16,FProject manager Jason Farrar said the
OL,17,Fwork would make the network more
OL,18,Fresilient and reduce the risk of bursts
OL,19,Fand disruption for customers.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
