OL,3,GNEWSAWater firm spends #315k on village
OL,4,Anetwork upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork will begin at the junction of
OL,7,FHighgate and York Road and progress
OL,8,Feastwards into Cherry Burton, before
OL,9,Ffinishing at the junction of Etton
OL,10,FRoad, Main Street and Bishop Burton
OL,11,FRoad, the firm said.
